          "default": ""
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Live sessions messaging each other (D-026). One command with an action, because the command cap leaves one slot: ``list`` shows peers, ``send`` posts a message from this daemon (``via`` says whether a person or a model wrote it), ``deliver`` and ``receipt`` are the daemon-to-daemon calls (a signed envelope in, a delivery receipt back). ``bus`` is the bus channel handing in one inbox envelope (D-040): the core checks it against the seat's pinned key and puts it through the same hold and trust policy as a peer message."
    },
